# deep_recursion_trap — NEGATIVE test (X-202). Unbounded self-recursion with no
# reachable base case: each call recurses on n+1, so the stack grows without
# bound and the program traps (non-zero exit) instead of returning a value.
# Expected: exit code != 0 (stack overflow / divergence trap).

DeepRecursionTrap is project
DeepRecursionTrap module examplesDeepRecursionTrap
DeepRecursionTrap target console
DeepRecursionTrap entry main

examplesDeepRecursionTrap is module
examplesDeepRecursionTrap path examples.deepRecursionTrap
examplesDeepRecursionTrap exports main
examplesDeepRecursionTrap purpose "Recurse without a base case to trip the stack-overflow trap"
examplesDeepRecursionTrap invariant "diverge never returns; the program traps"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32
ExitCode purpose "Process exit status"

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter purpose "Allow controlled writes to standard output"

diverge is operation
diverge in n Int64
diverge out Int64
diverge memory heap no
diverge async no
diverge purpose "Recurse on n+1 forever, overflowing the call stack"
diverge invariant "Has no reachable base case"
diverge let one immutable Int64 1
diverge do incCall
diverge do recCall
diverge return deeper

incCall is call
incCall in diverge
incCall invokes math.addInt64
incCall arg left Int64 n
incCall arg right Int64 one
incCall out nPlusOne Int64

recCall is call
recCall in diverge
recCall invokes diverge
recCall arg n Int64 nPlusOne
recCall out deeper Int64

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "Start the unbounded recursion"
main invariant "Never completes normally"
main let seedValue immutable Int64 0
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0
main do kickoff
main do writeCall
main return okCode

kickoff is call
kickoff in main
kickoff invokes diverge
kickoff arg n Int64 seedValue
kickoff out result Int64

writeCall is call
writeCall in main
writeCall invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeCall arg value Int64 result
